  "id": "operant-conditioning",
  "term": "operant conditioning",
  "definition": "Operant conditioning is a type of learning in which a person's or animal's responses help produce reinforcement. When the desired response is made from among possible behaviors, it is reinforced right away, which strengthens that response.",
